{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12700","headline":"登殊亭作 · 元结","name":"登殊亭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时节方大暑，试来登殊亭。\n凭轩未及息，忽若秋气生。\n主人既多闲，有酒共我倾。\n坐中不相异，岂恨醉与醒。\n漫歌无人听，浪语无人惊。\n时复一回望，心目出四溟。\n谁能守缨佩，日与灾患幷。\n请君诵此意，令彼惑者听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}